        <mxCell id="c97" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined: the Packing row. In 2026 it recorded 28,039 hours against 6,696 planned, 4.19 times the plan, but only 1,505 of them while its operations were open: 0.22 times. Every work center is below plan on that second ratio; Quality Assurance, with 331 planned hours, 1,328 recorded and 269 while open, reads 4.02 and 0.81. The grid is scrolled to rows 11 to 15, the work centers of 2026; the editor to the derived table and the final GROUP BY.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="716" width="860" height="57" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
